    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "A Windows multi-bash plugin for DeepSeek Harness. gitbash (Git for Windows / MSYS) is on by default. wslbash (WSL), msys2bash (MSYS2 UCRT64), sshshell (pooled SSH channels, key-only, many hosts) and sshscp (SFTP transfer on the same row) are opt-in. terminal keeps a real PTY sess"
